{"uid":"efbac0d85438a9fe","name":"test_an_unknown_task_id_exhausts_the_ladder_and_still_refuses_the_move","fullName":"tests.test_unsatisfiable_criteria#test_an_unknown_task_id_exhausts_the_ladder_and_still_refuses_the_move","historyId":"da9521c37da39fb7f01afe5f1dad3590","time":{"start":1791881165581,"stop":1791881165672,"duration":91},"description":"v0.13 task 005: same cutover as the no-reason case above -- an\n    unresolvable `task_id` is carried back through the SAME re-ask ladder\n    (`\"not found\"` on every `contract.violation` event, never a `log`\n    message the old pre-cutover assertion grepped) rather than aborting on\n    the first offence. With no budget ceiling here (`_run_resumed`'s\n    default `iterations=15`), the worker loop keeps self-looping on\n    `no_verdict_yet` every pass -- three genuinely stuck passes (each its\n    own full ladder) still trips the PRE-EXISTING `stagnation_exhausted`\n    guard exactly as a silent hat would (this task adds no escape hatch\n    from that). Since task 012 (`abdc914`) the guard on the (default) last\n    approach pauses and escalates rather than ending `failed` -- asserted\n    here via `_run_resumed_until_paused` (task 042, steer 004) -- never\n    `\"aborted\"`.","descriptionHtml":"<p>v0.13 task 005: same cutover as the no-reason case above -- an<br />\nunresolvable <code>task_id</code> is carried back through the SAME re-ask ladder<br />\n(<code>&quot;not found&quot;</code> on every <code>contract.violation</code> event, never a <code>log</code><br />\nmessage the old pre-cutover assertion grepped) rather than aborting on<br />\nthe first offence. With no budget ceiling here (<code>_run_resumed</code>'s<br />\ndefault <code>iterations=15</code>), the worker loop keeps self-looping on<br />\n<code>no_verdict_yet</code> every pass -- three genuinely stuck passes (each its<br />\nown full ladder) still trips the PRE-EXISTING <code>stagnation_exhausted</code><br />\nguard exactly as a silent hat would (this task adds no escape hatch<br />\nfrom that). Since task 012 (<code>abdc914</code>) the guard on the (default) last<br />\napproach pauses and escalates rather than ending <code>failed</code> -- asserted<br />\nhere via <code>_run_resumed_until_paused</code> (task 042, steer 004) -- never<br />\n<code>&quot;aborted&quot;</code>.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791880795115,"stop":1791880795116,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791880795116,"stop":1791880795116,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791881165563,"stop":1791881165569,"duration":6},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791881165563,"stop":1791881165563,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791881165569,"stop":1791881165575,"duration":6},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791881165569,"stop":1791881165569,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDi